        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist to help us release the game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1762096348\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎃 Welcome to <i>Spooky Night</i> 🎃</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is scarce, betrayal thrives, and every decision can be your last. <i>Spooky Night</i> is the ultimate  social deduction game, bringing friends and strangers together in a thrilling battle of wits and strategy. Will you expose the werewolves or fall victim to their cunning schemes? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Phase</strong>: Talk with other players and vote to eliminate someone you think is a werewolf.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/3dd2fb1947c0a91f4d9450b1557d96e2.poster.avif?t=1762096348\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/3dd2fb1947c0a91f4d9450b1557d96e2.webm?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/3dd2fb1947c0a91f4d9450b1557d96e2.mp4?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End of Day</strong>: The player with the most votes is eliminated and their role is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/6431c59e04efbb7db37f350476ff060e.poster.avif?t=1762096348\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/6431c59e04efbb7db37f350476ff060e.webm?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/6431c59e04efbb7db37f350476ff060e.mp4?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Phase</strong>: Werewolves attack, while villagers and other roles secretly use their abilities to protect, gather clues, or take action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/ee43bf741775f8b182e87ec8cac251c9.poster.avif?t=1762096348\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/ee43bf741775f8b182e87ec8cac251c9.webm?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/ee43bf741775f8b182e87ec8cac251c9.mp4?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the Game</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers win if all werewolves are eliminated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolves win if they equal or outnumber the villagers.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/c03ad91cd65c59f73dcfeaa71c96c963.poster.avif?t=1762096348\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/c03ad91cd65c59f73dcfeaa71c96c963.webm?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443650/extras/c03ad91cd65c59f73dcfeaa71c96c963.mp4?t=1762096348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎉 Why You’ll Love <i>Spooky Night</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is a fresh, unpredictable adventure. With a variety of unique roles and endless player strategies, no two games are ever the same. Build trust (or break it!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is entirely free to play! You'll earn rewards after every match and can unlock a wide range of character customizations. Purchasing the game allows you to acquire skins faster and expands your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
